ofs. It introduced mathematical techniques such as set theory and formal systems, enabling logical statements to be analyzed objectively.\n","source_host":"chatgpt.com","source_kind":"ai","from_self":false},"prev":"4f626b48c31eed1585e6608540fdc4c179056c71280af1d9f3c95b976035e980","hash":"e75fffee182c84a590c691ba677e4d11ad0bf0801f11a0ffd2f5f139cb66d3ba"},{"v":1,"id":"a2a8f5ec-7109-4c89-8660-6e84837548e9","seq":41,"session":"6ef3e665-2a24-4936-9595-4c7b43d2ed31","doc":"1f2a25dc-f227-5a7a-a81e-ac5037928db4","ts":"2026-09-16T08:04:56.420966Z","kind":"paste","data":{"paste_id":"a2f4dda4-13d6-4a2d-a09e-ed96cb04d81a","pos":1637,"text":"The transition from philosophical logic to mathematical logic brought several advantages. The mathematical approach allowed for precise deductions and formal proofs, making arguments clearer and less prone to ambiguity. Mathematical logic also paved the way for computational logic, which has revolutionized fields like computer science. Additionally, mathematical logic has enabled advancements in artificial intelligence and automated reasoning.\n","source_host":"chatgpt.com","source_kind":"ai","from_self":false},"prev":"e75fffee182c84a590c691ba677e4d11ad0bf0801f11a0ffd2f5f139cb66d3ba","hash":"3ef2dde8e85bb01b32a133b5331e9f1ad523e44bbd8db7788b148743448fe9aa"},{"v":1,"id":"b3a93501-d2cd-488c-989a-0e2f168d9603","seq":42,"session":"6ef3e665-2a24-4936-9595-4c7b43d2ed31","doc":"1f2a25dc-f227-5a7a-a81e-ac5037928db4","ts":"2026-09-16T08:06:52.722826Z","kind":"snapshot","data":{"text_hash":"b034dd65d1ca8288aad48be7221bbe7c7b794d604c2b52266b5dded5e4bd06b7","chars":2085,"words":300,"lines":5},"prev":"3ef2dde8e85bb01b32a133b5331e9f1ad523e44bbd8db7788b148743448fe9aa","hash":"5975c0fd7a925a9ca9193e64721a557485fbea4b3442ef0c5f4b8f1aa4dda351"},{"v":1,"id":"026d6327-4008-406f-85b5-4b779bfb8c61","seq":43,"session":"6ef3e665-2a24-4936-9595-4c7b43d2ed31","doc":"1f2a25dc-f227-5a7a-a81e-ac5037928db4","ts":"2026-09-16T08:06:52.722826Z","kind":"paste","data":{"paste